    "notes": "Schedules 2, 3 (and their 6-8 half-hour counterparts) are excluded because they apply 3% reductions, one-year lag rates, or are specific to one-half hour prime time dramatic television (not theatrical). Schedules 4 and 5 are excluded as they apply only to High Budget SVOD programs/series under Long-Form Sideletter terms with one- or two-year lag rates. Schedule 10 (Distant Location, 3% reduction) and Schedule 11 (Distant Location, one-year lag) are excluded for the same reasons as their studio counterparts. Schedules 1 and 9 are the only ones listing 'Theatrical Motion Pictures' as an applicable category at full, undiscounted, non-lagged rates. Page ranges include the footnote pages immediately following each rate table, since those footnotes pertain specifically to the 8/2/26-7/31/27 rates shown on the preceding page."
